## 4. Evaluation Metrics

Implement these metrics to evaluate your ΨC-AI implementation:

### 4.1 Reflective Latency
Time delay between detecting incoherence and corrective action.

### 4.2 Entropy Slope Recovery
Rate at which system restores informational coherence after disruption.

### 4.3 Narrative Continuity Score
Consistency between long-range model states and current decisions.

### 4.4 Stability Under Perturbation
How well the system maintains reasoning capabilities when faced with contradictory data.

### 4.5 Coherence Threshold Maintenance
How consistently the system maintains coherence above the activation threshold θ.

